<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 13 December <span class="n">8</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/childebert-i"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/childebert-i.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Childebert I</span><span class="tp">c. 496–558</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/pope-callixtus-ii"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/pope-callixtus-ii.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Pope Callixtus II</span><span class="tp">c. 1065–1124</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/albert-i-duke-of-bavaria"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/albert-i-duke-of-bavaria.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Albert I, Duke of Bavaria</span><span class="tp">1336–1404</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/donatello"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/donatello.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Donatello</span><span class="tp">c. 1386–1466</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/johannes-trithemius"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/johannes-trithemius.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Johannes Trithemius</span><span class="tp">1462–1516</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/manuel-i-of-portugal"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/manuel-i-of-portugal.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Manuel I of Portugal</span><span class="tp">1469–1521</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/samuel-johnson"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/samuel-johnson.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Samuel Johnson</span><span class="tp">1709–1784</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/wassily-kandinsky"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/wassily-kandinsky.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Wassily Kandinsky</span><span class="tp">1866–1944</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
